title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/festivals.jpg
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Outside of electoral politics, the PSOE runs a social world onto itself.

= Party Organizations

In addition to being a political party, the PSOE is a social world onto itself, with a vast array of associated organizations which serve the social needs of their members from cradle to grave.

- @newspapers: Fund more newspapers and journalists.
- @welfare: Fund more mutual aid and welfare programs.
- @culture: Fund sports leagues, educational, and cultural programs.
- @js: Fund the Juventudes Socialistas, our youth organization.
- @youth: We have the reputation of being a party for old men. Support the youth organizations.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard

@newspapers
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_timer = 0;
go-to: media

# TODO: differing outcomes based on whether you've seen media, and what kind of media you've supported.


@welfare
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_psoe += 5*(1 - dissent);

We have increased funding to Workers' Welfare. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among the unemployed. ?]

@culture
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; cultural_organizations += 1; caballeristas_dissent -= 6; prietistas_dissent -= 6; besteiristas_dissent -= 6

It is not enough for the PSOE to solely be a political party. We have various organizations like sports festivals, schools or libraries, which are crucial to our members' lives. Funding these organizations makes our members more committed to the party, even when our policies might not be to their liking.

[? if mf_strength > 500 : However, it feels frivolous to spend on sports and choirs when the fascists are murdering us in the streets. ?]

@js
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; js_strength  += 100; js_militancy += 0.01; juventudes_timer = 0; funded_juventudes += 1

We have increased the ranks of the Juventudes Socialistas.

@youth
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; js_strength += 50; js_militancy += 0.02; young_socialists += 1; caballeristas_strength += 5; prietistas_strength += 2; radicalization += 1;

Our new youth members flock mostly to the Caballeristas and to the Prietistas wing in a lesser extent. It also bring new members to the Juventudes Socialsitas, many of them radicalizated.

@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations.

- @return: Continue...
